<p><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Rosalinde.</hi></hi></hi></p> <lb n="pen_140.019"/>
<p><hi rendition="#aq"><lg><l>Willkommen, allgütiger Mai!</l> <lb n="pen_140.020"/>
